"R2q1rk1/1bpp1ppp/5n2/1pb1p3/4P3/1PNP1N2/1P3PPP/2BQ1RK1 b - -":{"variation":"arkhangelsk-variation","moves":[{"uci":"b7a8","notes":[{"text":"The position is fairly even, and most top games from here end in a draw.","original":"Black recaptures the rook and now in this position, white is considered to be slight better but it's a fairly even position. Most of the top games from this point have ended in a draw.","ideas":[{"type":"evaluation","value":"equal"}]}],"games":[4,5,15,12,7]},{"uci":"d8a8","notes":[{"text":"Retaking with the queen is not advised; you are better here than after the bishop retake.","original":"This is not advised, white is considered better in this position than if black had taken with the bishop.","ideas":[{"type":"evaluation","value":"whiteSlightly"}]}],"games":[7,15,19,8,6]}]},
